WEBVTT

00:06:25.214 --> 00:06:31.011
These aerobes perceive each other
through high-frequency radio waves,

00:06:31.011 --> 00:06:33.222
and they use thermal sensing

00:06:33.264 --> 00:06:36.392
to detect other living creatures
in their environment.

00:06:38.394 --> 00:06:42.398
An aerobe might be curious
about your heat signature,

00:06:42.398 --> 00:06:46.235
and fly over to greet and flirt with you,

00:06:46.277 --> 00:06:49.572
while other aerobes are more shy

00:06:49.572 --> 00:06:52.324
and might go out of their way
to avoid a crowd.

00:06:53.742 --> 00:06:58.414
How will these machines and humans
be together in the world?

00:06:59.707 --> 00:07:01.459
What will this world look like?